      "motion_no": 1,
      "section": "ZONE CHANGE/PUBLIC HEARING",
      "body": "PlanningCommission",
      "motion": "recommendation for item number 1 for modifying the zone from R-10 to PD-R at Chandler Heights with staff recommendations. On the North and East lots 11-21, limiting those lots to single level as measured per City Zoning to 16 ft height per code, single level with a walk out basement. Additionally, storage garages would not be allowed in our approval. The submitted elevations for the townhomes are not approved and do not meet City standards. They would need to re-submit to the council modified elevations that meet the requirements. We would make the findings that roofs are pitched on those same lots; no flat roofs with staff findings as recommended. The reasonings for the single level is to not encroach on the neighbor’s privacy, peace and serenity in their own backyard or home or private residences.",
